<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Ballarat says take no action on bid.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Ballarat says take no action on bid.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ballarat Brewing Co Ltd said on Friday that its independent directors recommended that directors take no action on the A$2.50 per share cash takeover offer by Foster's Brewing Group Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said a detailed recommendation from Ballarat directors would be provided in the Part B statement.</p>
<p>Foster's has a 41.6 percent stake in Ballarat, which has tourism and gaming operations. The offer by Foster's unit Carlton and United Breweries is five cents per share above a rival bid by Guinness Peat Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
